00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.930
There's also a products page where we can
take a closer look at some of the other Kaslan

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:55.280
products, like their drone who looks like
a flying shark and can fly 100 mph and track

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:59.680
it's victims using advanced algorithms to
track a subject as it flies up to 10,000 feet

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:00.680
overhead.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.960
If this thing is tracking you, you're never
going to be safe.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.280
There's also the vacuum that we saw in the
trailer, it's hard to imagine that being a

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.150
threat to man, but you never know.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:12.330
The Kaslan K-One speakers have the capability
to track your movements to ensure location

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:16.150
focused personalized sound reproductions,
and this is what I think Chucky is going to

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.400
